{op:"add",path:"/spec/definitions/-",value:{id:"D018",symbol:"Hscale",type:"original unnormalized positive-exponent Hausdorff content H^p_δ(A), valued in [0,∞]",definition:"For a metric space Z, A⊆Z, real p>0 and finite real δ>0, Hscale(p,δ,A), also written H^p_δ(A), is inf{∑_{i≥0}(diam U_i)^p : A⊆⋃_{i≥0}U_i, and diam U_i≤δ for all i}. Here admissible members U_i are bounded subsets of Z; their ordinary diameter is sup{dist(x,y): x,y∈U_i} in [0,∞), with diameter of ∅ equal to zero. Equivalently the memberwise admissibility condition is dist(x,y)≤δ for every x,y in each U_i. Covers are countable, represented by ℕ-indexed families, with finite covers padded by ∅, and each empty member contributes zero. No measurability, openness, or intersection-with-A restriction is imposed on cover members. All sums and infima are taken in [0,∞], and an infimum over no admissible cover is ∞. In Euclidean Z this is precisely the original formula and conventions of problem.md:34–43; the same formula defines its metric-space extension. The cutoff is ≤δ, and there is no multiplicative dimensional normalization.",depends_on:[],requires:[],binders:[{symbol:"Z",type:"metric space"},{symbol:"A",type:"subset of Z"},{symbol:"p",type:"positive real"},{symbol:"δ",type:"positive real"},{symbol:"U",type:"ℕ→Set Z"},{symbol:"x",type:"Z"},{symbol:"y",type:"Z"}],objects:["Z","A","p","δ","U","x","y"]}},
{op:"add",path:"/spec/definitions/-",value:{id:"D019",symbol:"Hmeasure",type:"original unnormalized positive-exponent Hausdorff measure H^p(A), valued in [0,∞]",definition:"For a metric space Z, A⊆Z and real p>0, Hmeasure(p,A), also written H^p(A), is sup_{δ∈ℝ, δ>0} Hscale(p,δ,A). This is the original H^p(A)=sup_{δ>0} H^p_δ(A) of problem.md:34–43, using exactly D018's countable covers, empty-member costs and cutoff convention. It has no multiplicative normalization and is defined on every subset A, without a measurability requirement. On general metric spaces we use this same formula as the extension of the supplied Euclidean definition.",depends_on:["D018"],requires:[],binders:[{symbol:"Z",type:"metric space"},{symbol:"A",type:"subset of Z"},{symbol:"p",type:"positive real"},{symbol:"δ",type:"positive real"}],objects:["Z","A","p","δ","Hscale"]}},
{op:"add",path:"/graph/inferences/0/definitions/-",value:"D018"},
